Subject: [PATCH] dm-verity: align struct dm_verity_fec_io properly
Message-ID: <443cfa90-14e9-19ef-cad3-42ed54c4ae5@redhat.com>
Precedence: bulk
X-Mailing-List: dm-devel@lists.linux.dev
List-Id: <dm-devel.lists.linux.dev>
